  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a scvi_n200-based multiprofile RNA-only model. Validation accuracy increased slightly to 0.6530 (F1 0.6283), suggesting transformer aggregation may offer marginal improvement over avgpool. However, the exact contribution of the aggregation method remains uncertain due to potential confounding factors from the multiprofile setting and limited comparative evidence."
